overset{^}{x}}_{4})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(1-2)^{2}+(2-2)^{2}+(-3-(-1))^{2}+(-3-0)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+0+4+9} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
